# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI-DOS .cursorignore (template)
# Copy this file to the repository root as `.cursorignore`.
# (Agents cannot create `.cursorignore` themselves; Cursor protects the file.)
#
# Asks Cursor not to index or read these files.
# BEST-EFFORT ONLY — NOT A SECURITY BOUNDARY. Content can still reach the AI
# via terminal output, explicit attachment or other tools. Keep secrets out of
# the workspace in the first place (governance/security/secrets-and-data.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets, keys, credentials ---------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.csr
*.kdbx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.ppk
credentials
credentials.*
*credentials*.json
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
service-account*.json
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# --- Runtime state and logs -------------------------------------------------
orchestration/state/runtime/
.ai-dos/state/runtime/
*.audit.log
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/

# --- Embedded AI-DOS: inactive master entry files (generator sources only) --
# The project entry points are the generated files in the project root.
.ai-dos/.cursor/
.ai-dos/AGENTS.md
.ai-dos/CLAUDE.md

# --- Large / binary / generated ---------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
